      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The most recent change to knee behavior is to bring it in line with the legacy handling of the IKPose. This is still just as customizable but works differently compared to how it was working in the previous ik beta build. In the last build, the knees would bend in the direction that knees bent while the IKPose was active. In the current build (and with legacy behavior) the knee bend direction will be locked in as forward relative to the feet during the IKPose.\nThat means if you'd like your knees to bend towards your avatar's heels rather than toes, make a custom IKPose that has the legs rotated such that the heels are pointed forward.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
